WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:03.320
Open the hub. Choose Circle.

00:03.320 --> 00:05.690
Draw on the page. The mark saves automatically.

00:05.690 --> 00:08.580
Open Send to use your saved mark.

00:08.580 --> 00:10.800
Add a clear request.

00:10.800 --> 00:15.900
Send. The request is pending in History.
